-**Purpose**: [one sentence]
-**Layout**: [FULL_CENTER / LEFT_RIGHT / GRID / PROGRESSIVE]
-
-### Visual elements
-- [Mobject: type, position, color]
-
-### Animation sequence
-1. [Animation] -- [what it reveals] (~Ns)
-
-### Subtitle
-"[text]"
-```
