-### Inputs & Forms
-- **Select dropdown**: White background, `#000000` text, 1px solid `rgb(118, 118, 118)` border
-- **Focus**: Uses Framer's focus outline system (`--framer-focus-outline`)
-- **Text input**: 8px radius, standard border treatment
