-### Navigation
-- **Top nav**: White/transparent background, Cal Sans links at near-black
-- **Nav text**: `#111111` (Midnight) for primary links, `#000000` for emphasis
-- **CTA button**: Dark Primary in the nav — high contrast call-to-action
