-## 6. Depth & Elevation
-
-| Level | Treatment | Use |
-|-------|-----------|-----|
-| Flat (Level 0) | No shadow | White body, text blocks |
-| Bordered (Level 1) | `1px solid #202020` | Cards, buttons, containers |
