-## 6. Depth & Elevation
-
-| Level | Treatment | Use |
-|-------|-----------|-----|
-| Flat (Level 0) | No shadow | Everything — Revolut uses zero shadows |
-| Focus | `0 0 0 0.125rem` ring | Accessibility focus |
