-## 7. Do's and Don'ts
-- Do: Use WF Visual Sans Variable at 500–600. Blue (#146ef5) for CTAs. 4px radius. translate(6px) hover.
-- Don't: Round beyond 8px for functional elements. Use secondary colors on primary CTAs.
